# Load files from the amplicon analysis results

Load asv tables generated in the last step

```{r}
otutabtax <- read.table("o16S_asvtab.txt", header = TRUE, sep = "\t")
otutabtax <- as.data.frame(otutabtax)
otutabtax <- otutabtax[,-1] # remove sequences
```

Create a metadata file with all the necessary sample information and identical sample names to those in the asv table. 

```{r}
# read in new metadata
meta <- read.table("full_metadata.txt", header = TRUE, sep = '\t')
# make the rownames the sample IDs
meta <- as.data.frame(meta)
row.names(meta) <- meta$sample_id
meta <- meta[,-1]
```

